  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_033) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.713). This experiment tests replacing the RNA encoder with scgpt while keeping other components identical, isolating the impact of the RNA encoder choice. This addresses uncertainty about whether scgpt (a more complex encoder) could further improve performance, aligning with the principle of testing critical design choices when evidence is strong."
